{"title":"Ski Holiday","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/6m66hx","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/level-04","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025","speaker":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"soundButtons","instruction":{"text":"Listen and choose."},"shuffleButtons":true,"shuffleAtoms":true,"atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/gloves.lsg","b":[{"sound":"gloves","correct":true},{"sound":"loves"}]},{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/scarf.lsg","b":[{"sound":"scarf","correct":true},{"sound":"scallfe"}]},{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/beanie.lsg","b":[{"sound":"beanie","correct":true},{"sound":"deany"}]}]},{"trainer":"content","instruction":"Listen.","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anapacking.lsg"},{"text":"","sound":"I can’t wait to go skiing over the Christmas break!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"I’m so excited! It’s going to be freezing in Italy this time of year though, isn’t it?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f6_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes, that’s why I’m packing a beanie, some gloves and three jumpers.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Why not a scarf? Then you won’t need to bring as many jumpers. Also, you’re going to be wearing a helmet, so there is no need for a beanie.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f6_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"I hate wearing scarves, and I want to take a beanie anyway! We aren’t going to be wearing a helmet all the time. I don’t want to be cold.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yeah, okay, that makes sense. We should also pack Santa hats to wear on Christmas day!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f6_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes, let’s do it!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"kidDragGroup","onSamePageOnce":true,"instruction":{"text":"Drag."},"finishButton":true,"groupLayout":"backgroundLsg","backgroundLsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/kdg-suitcase-ana.lsg","width":400},"hideLsgZones":false,"shadowMode":"object","shuffleDragElements":true,"groups":{"groupId":1,"zone":"1"},"dragElements":[{"elementCategory":"cat1","total":1,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/santa-hat.lsg","width":60,"solvedWidth":50},"sound":{"start":"santa hat"}},{"elementCategory":"cat1","total":1,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/beanie-copy.lsg","width":50,"solvedWidth":35},"sound":{"start":"beanie"}},{"elementCategory":"cat1","total":1,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/gloves-copy.lsg","width":60,"solvedWidth":40},"sound":{"start":"gloves"}},{"elementCategory":"cat1","total":1,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/3jumpers.lsg","width":100,"solvedWidth":100},"sound":{"start":"3 jumpers"}},{"elementCategory":"cat2","total":1,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/scarf-copy.lsg","width":80},"sound":{"start":"scarf"}},{"elementCategory":"cat2","total":1,"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/4jumpers.lsg","width":100},"sound":{"start":"four-jumpers"}}],"atoms":{"groupId":1,"elementCategory":"cat1","total":4}},{"trainer":"multipleChoice","instruction":{"text":"Choose. More than one answer can be correct."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleButtons":true,"onSamePage":true,"atoms":[{"a":"What is Ana packing for?","b":["++She is going on a skiing holiday.","She is going to France.","++She is going to Italy.","She is going on a city break."]},{"a":"Which holiday is Ana travelling for?","b":["++She is travelling for Christmas.","She is travelling for Easter.","She is travelling for Diwali.","She is travelling for Halloween."]}]},{"trainer":"content","instruction":"Listen.","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anapacking.lsg"},{"text":"","sound":"Actually, I think I’m going to go to the shops to buy three more t-shirts. I don’t want to catch a cold on holiday!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f6_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"How are t-shirts going to stop you from getting a cold? You need something warmer!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"I will layer them under my jumper. That way I have more space in my suitcase.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f6_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Why do you need more space in your suitcase?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Oh, I want to buy souvenirs as Christmas presents for my friends!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f6_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Oh, that’s a great idea!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"dragGroup","instruction":{"text":"Who says what? Match."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleAtoms":true,"lsg":{"width":120},"cats":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana-dG.lsg"},{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/anassister-1.lsg"}],"atoms":[{"cat":1,"b":"I don’t want to catch a cold on holiday!","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/speech1.lsg"},{"cat":1,"b":"I want to buy souvenirs as Christmas presents for my friends.","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/speech2.lsg"},{"cat":0,"b":"You need something warmer!","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/speech3.lsg"},{"cat":0,"b":"Why do you need more space in your suitcase?","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/speech4.lsg"}]},{"trainer":"buttons","instruction":{"text":"True or false? Choose."},"shuffleAtoms":true,"trueFalseMod